# 3-RV_D1SK2_L1_C_Program_To_Compute_Sum_From_1_to_N

## Introduction

This lecture introduces a simple C program used to compute the sum of numbers from 1 to N.

The purpose of this lecture is to understand basic C program structure, observe how high-level programs are compiled, prepare for RISC-V compilation and assembly analysis and connect software execution with hardware implementation.
This program will later be compiled using the RISC-V GCC toolchain.

---

# Problem Statement

Compute:

```text
1 + 2 + 3 + ... + N
```



