# Program Explanation

## Variable Declaration


```text
int i, sum = 0, n = 5;
```

- i → loop counter
- sum → stores running total
- n → upper limit

---

## For Loop Operation

```text
for(i = 1; i <= n; i++)
```

Loop behavior:

- starts from 1
- increments by 1
- stops at n

---

## Accumulation Logic

```text
sum = sum + i;
```

At every iteration current value of i is added to sum.


